              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 9.4: Winnowing"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.424,
            0.284,
            0.521
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Valli is unable to separate husk from rice in a closed room. How can you help her?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.288,
            0.442,
            0.331,
            0.498
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.37,
            0.428,
            0.884,
            0.511
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This method of separating heavier and lighter components of a mixture by wind or by blowing air is called "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "winnowing.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Have you seen any similar kind of activity being done at your home?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.18,
            0.611,
            0.251,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.18,
                0.611,
